build/
*.class
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

demo/*

# Next's own build cache. The export beside it is committed on purpose —
# viewer/out, like the generated protobuf sources, so that a student never needs
# npm — but this is 109 MB that `npx next build` rewrites every time, and it was
# being carried by everybody who clones this.
viewer/.next/
viewer/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# Where s10-console.ts emits the views so it can render them without a browser.
viewer/.check/
# Same story as .next, one directory over: 380 MB and 10,964 files, which is
# 96% of everything this repo tracked. It arrived with the viewer in 35ad1b0
# and nobody meant it to. package-lock.json is committed, so `npm ci` in
# viewer/ puts it back byte for byte — and only a developer rebuilding the
# export ever needs it, because viewer/out is what a student actually loads.
viewer/node_modules/
